      "writtenOn": "2019-02-05T19:31:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Another thing to note here: This solution works under the assumption that all temp sensors are powered using the same GPIO. e.g. Ampton has two temp_sensors (get_temp_3v3_51k1_47k_4050b and get_temp_3v3_13k7_47k_4050b), but from the code it looks like only one of them is powered using a GPIO. There could be interesting combinations that could come up because of that e.g. if sensor1 is powered using a GPIO and board uses this config then sensor2 might check for that GPIO even though it is never powered off. Not sure if this can have any side-effects.",
      "revId": "e7e807f78fe20a718c9636f643196e5a1ba54a03",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
